  <ThingDef ParentName="MUG_ThrowableBase">
    <defName>MUG_Flashbang</defName>
    <label>flashbang grenade</label>
    <description>A non-lethal throwable used for tactical suppression. Detonating on impact, it releases a blinding flash and a deafening roar, instantly incapacitating organic beings within its blast radius.

The intense shock effect causes widespread stunning and forcibly interrupts enemy actions. Because it relies entirely on sensory overload and deals no physical damage, it is completely useless against mechanoids.

"Organics get stunned, mechanoids don't. That's how we screen for robot spies around here."</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/MUG_Flashbang</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>60</MaxHitPoints>
