  <ThingDef ParentName="MUG_ThrowableBase">
    <defName>MUG_GravityTrap</defName>
    <label>gravity trap</label>
    <description>A tactical device with an advanced built-in gravity generator. Upon landing, it instantly creates a localized, intense gravitational field, dragging any unit that steps into the area firmly to the ground.
 
Within this extremely dense gravity well, the movement speed of all units is drastically reduced, and the use of any psychic abilities is severely disrupted.
 
"It involves some reality-editing tech, but the margins here are too narrow to write it down."</description>
