  <ThingDef ParentName="MUG_ThrowableBase">
    <defName>MUG_HealingSmoke</defName>
    <label>healing smoke grenade</label>
    <description>A specialized smoke canister filled with aerosolized medical gel and micro-mechanites. Upon detonation, it releases a dense cloud of healing smoke that provides rapid, automatic mending to lifeforms enveloped within.
 
The healing field automatically prioritizes the most severe wounds on a victim, while the thick smokescreen effectively blocks the line of sight for automated turrets.
 
"It cannot regenerate missing limbs, it really can't."</description>
